{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 6, :comments ["<b>And the children of Israel journeyed from Be'erot.</b> According to the plain sense, Moserah is not Moserot of the stages, and Be'erot Ya'akan is not Ya'akan, and between Be'erot and Moserah was Mount Hor, and there Aharon died. And this is the meaning of the verse: ״ובני ישראל נסעו מבארות בני יעקן״ — to go to Moserah, and they encountered Mount Hor, and there Aharon died."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 10, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:00:44.818516535Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}